  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Reconversion Agro-Empresarial</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Retooling Agro-Enterprise</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS TO ACCELERATE THE EMERGENCE OF COMPETITIVE AND SUSTAINABLE AGRICULTURAL BASED ENTERPRISES IN EL SALVADOR BY STRENGTHENING THE PROVISION OF KEY PUBLIC GOODS AND SERVICES AND TO MOBILIZE STRATEGIC PUBLIC-PRIVATE PARTNERSHIPS. IT HAS 4 COMPONENTES: 1) INFORMATION SYSTEM; 2)AGROTECHNOLOGY PARTERSHIPS; 3) SANITARY AND FOOD SAFETY PROTECTION; AND 4) IRRIGATION MANAGEMENT AND CROP DIVERSIFICATION.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
